{{#> base}}
    <h2>IFCA Event Registration Confirmation</h2>
    <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
    
    <p>Your registration for the following IFCA event has been confirmed:</p>
    
    <div class="alert alert-success">
        <h3>Event Details</h3>
        <p><strong>Event:</strong> {{eventName}}<br>
        <strong>Date:</strong> {{eventDate}}<br>
        <strong>Time:</strong> {{eventTime}}<br>
        <strong>Venue:</strong> {{eventVenue}}<br>
        <strong>Registration ID:</strong> {{registrationId}}</p>
    </div>

    <p>Please keep this email for your reference. You can view the event details and add it to your calendar using the button below:</p>
    
    <a href="{{eventUrl}}" class="button">View Event Details</a>

    <div class="metadata">
        <p><strong>Important Information:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>Please arrive 30 minutes before the event start time for registration</li>
            <li>Bring your IFCA membership card and a valid photo ID</li>
            <li>Dress code: Professional Chef's Uniform or Business Formal</li>
            <li>Parking facilities are available at the venue</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <p>For any queries regarding the event, please contact our events team:</p>
    <p>Email: events@ifcaindia.com<br>
    Phone: +91 00000 00000</p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>
    The IFCA Events Team</p>
{{/base}} 